    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23086" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭn -exstinctus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in - ext-</span></b> ), a, um, adj.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>unextinguished</i>, <i>unextinguishable</i>
			(Ovidian). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ignis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					6, 297</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fames,</span>”
				<i>unappeasable</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Ib. 6, 428</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nomen,</span>”
				<i>imperishable</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tr. 5, 14, 36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">libido,</span>”
				<i>insatiable</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. F.
					1, 413</span></i>
			.</div>
